<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1" ProductVersion="3.1.4026.8">
  <Itf Name="IComparable" Id="{da2384b8-6baf-4ae5-8724-6db0c711add5}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*

## Short summary

This interface is used to make objects comparable in order to be able to sort them.

.. <legal notes>

legal notes
=================
